\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Validation metrics trajectory with 95\% confidence intervals across 50 epochs (n=710 samples per epoch). (a) PSNR surpasses target of 30 dB at epoch 38 and peaks at 30.91±0.42 dB at epoch 44. (b) SSIM exceeds target of 0.95 at epoch 22 and reaches 0.9869±0.0011 at best epoch. (c,d) CER and WER (inverted Y-axis: lower is better) approach clean GT baseline (dashed green line), demonstrating effective restoration for HTR downstream task. Best model at epoch 44 (red star markers) selected via data-driven criteria, not arbitrary stopping. Narrow confidence intervals validate consistent performance across validation set.\relax }}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:validation_metrics}{{7}{13}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Contoh restorasi kualitatif pada dokumen ANRI autentik abad ke-17-18 (n=15). Setiap pasangan menunjukkan masukan terdegradasi (kiri) dan keluaran terrestorasi (kanan). \textbf  {Baris 1 (a-c):} Kasus sukses dengan kontras tinggi ($\geq $60) menunjukkan pembersihan latar signifikan dan preservasi teks. \textbf  {Baris 2 (d-f):} Kasus menantang dengan kontras rendah-sedang menggunakan strategi peningkatan konservatif untuk menghindari pembangkitan artifak. Panel (a) K66b\_065\_119 (kontras=63.5), (b) K66b\_070\_179 (65.8), (c) K66b\_005\_0526\_ori (73.6), (d) K66b\_059\_067 (15.0, memudar ekstrem), (e) K66a\_2525\_0024 (29.7), (f) K66b\_064\_278 (52.0). Titik simpan: production\_v3, epoch 88.\relax }}{14}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:anri_qualitative}{{8}{14}}
